<title>PHILIPPINES: Cebu Property 1996 net 116.332 mln pesos.</title>
<headline>Cebu Property 1996 net 116.332 mln pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cebu Property Ventures &amp; Development Corp posted a net income of 116.332 million pesos last year, documents submitted to the Philippine Stock Exchange on Friday showed.</p>
<p>Revenues reached 283.921 million pesos, while cost and expenses totalled 167.589 million pesos.</p>
<p>No comparative figures were given by the firm which is a subsidiary of Ayala Corp</p>
<p>- Manila newsroom 63 2 8418938 Fax 8176267</p>
